This standalone service contains Python adaptations of Vela request builders and
positional response parsers, and a bundled calibration snapshot.

Upstream: https://github.com/PimpinPumpkin/Vela
Audited commit: 3c8fc207652e7a4fabfe53089de6ccace308ac61
Calibration version: 26
Upstream license: GNU General Public License version 3 (see LICENSE).

Derived sources: core/data/google/{GoogleMapsDataSource,GoogleResponse,SearchPb,
DirectionsPb,StreetViewParser}, core/data/google/parse/{SearchParser,PhotosParser,
ReviewFeedParser,DirectionsParser}, core/config/Calibration, and
app/web/WebReviewsFetcher (paths relative to Vela's src/main/java/app/vela).
See docs/provenance.json for exact source paths.

This project is independent from the Datathon project. It is not an official
Google API or a hosted Vela backend. Source licensing is separate from the
terms governing external services and their content.
